# Import profiles from Helium and Thorium, and complete Arc/Dia discovery.
#
# Helium and Thorium reuse the Chrome importer. Their importer types follow
# Helium's last one (TYPE_ZEN); Arc and Dia retain their existing types and
# importers, including Helium's Arc sidebar bookmark support.
#
# Krypton corrects Arc's Windows path to LocalCache/Local/Arc/User Data and
# enables Dia discovery on Windows at %LOCALAPPDATA%/Dia/User Data. Upstream
# omits Arc's application subfolder and restricts Dia discovery to macOS.

--- a/chrome/browser/importer/brave_external_process_importer_client.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/importer/brave_external_process_importer_client.cc
@@ -25,6 +25,8 @@
